{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Observation (2026-11-19 PST)\n`test.yml` dispatched on main at `92d3f373e2c` (run 44503581058), job `sweep (windows)` 135490319213: 14 failed, 20,016 passed.\n- 12 also failed on main at `3f47117c97b` (run 44487190183, job 135433617476, 13 failures). They compare backslash paths against forward-slash expectations or vice versa:\n  - `tests/unit/store/test_store_paths.py::test_exactly_one_rebar_dir_definition_under_src`\n  - `tests/unit/test_repo_root_from_package_guard.py::test_the_only_sanctioned_site_is_the_resolver_seam`\n  - `tests/unit/test_repo_root_from_tracker_guard.py` (2 tests)\n  - `tests/unit/test_single_definition_helpers.py::test_the_argparse_positive_int_is_defined_once_and_its_namesake_survives`\n  - `tests/unit/test_uv_pin_guard.py` (7 tests): the expected message uses `infra\\compose\\Dockerfile.svc`, while the script prints `infra/compose/Dockerfile.svc`.\n- 2 are new since `04e175d70eb` (ticket `livid-painful-mosquito`, closed): `tests/unit/test_git_ssh_output_encoding.py::test_run_git_encodes_str_stdin_as_utf8[process-group]` and `[subprocess-run]` (blob SHA mismatch on Windows, which points at a newline translation of the stdin text).\n- The previous run's one other failure, `test_store_commit_maintenance_bd66.py::test_write_survives_foreground_maintenance_repack` (worker crash), did not recur.\n\n## Resolution evidence (2026-11-19 PST)\nAll 14 failures are fixed on main by commits that landed under other tickets: the 5 path-separator guard tests (obtuse-phenocryst-verdin), the 7 `test_uv_pin_guard.py` cases (arctic-unsecular-esok), and the 2 `test_run_git_encodes_str_stdin_as_utf8` cases (scholastic-travelsick-salmon). None of the 14 node ids appears in `.github/windows-sweep-deselect/unclassified.args` (the only remaining deselect file), and none of the 6 test modules carries a Windows `skipif`.\n`gh workflow run test.yml --ref main` dispatch run 44621093373 at `0fec72331c4` (2026-11-19 13:40 PST): job `sweep (windows)` 135902646205 concluded `success`, \"20269 passed, 872 skipped\" with no failure.\nThe 2 failures in later main runs are owned elsewhere: `test_mcp_opcert_signing_goose.py::test_compose_startup_binding_fails_closed_on_bad_key` by plump-smelly-indianabat, and `test_identity_ts3_117b.py::test_off_keyring_signature_fails_enforcement` (new at `9a6ed375112`) by legatine-good-feline.\n\n## Approach\nVerification-only close. No repository file changes under this ticket: the fixes already landed under the tickets named above, so this ticket records the dispatch evidence and closes.\n\n## Scope\nNo repository files. Evidence lives in this ticket's description and comments (run and job ids above).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `sweep (windows)` on main passes, or each remaining failure has its own ticket; verified by the job result of a `gh workflow run test.yml --ref main` dispatch."}},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1795144442969236001,"uuid":"67e2a4c9-16ff-4a2a-8c5e-8bb327ef579b"}